<thead>
<tr><th>What you're seeing</th><th>What it often points to</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Straining, squatting repeatedly, little urine each time</td><td>Classic UTI sign; can also mean a bladder stone blocking flow</td></tr>
<tr><td>House accidents in a previously reliable dog</td><td>UTI is common, but also check for age-related incontinence or kidney issues</td></tr>
